      },
      {
        "text": "The president’s power to grant pardons extends only to those formally involved in the justice system.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes that preemptive pardons undermine democratic norms and rule of law.",
        "confidence": 0.91
